      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "East Norwich experiences a mix of humid subtropical and humid continental weather, with hot, humid summers and cool, snowy winters.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
